# OmacVM.app: virtio-gpu's vblank is a kernel timer at the display's rate,
# and DRM keeps it running 5 s after every frame (300-600 wakeups of an idle
# VM per frame). 100 ms is plenty for a timer. The same value for a drm
# module loaded later is in /etc/modprobe.d/omacvm-vblank.conf.
w /sys/module/drm/parameters/vblankoffdelay - - - - 100
